/QwenImageEdit2509_LoRA/blob/main/QIE_image2body_V2_dim4_1e-3-000078.safetensors)\n\n**Text encoder**\n\n- [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n\n**VAE**\n\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── qwen_image_edit_2509_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 loras/\n│   │   |── Qwen-Image-Lightning-4steps-V1.0.safetensors\n│   │   └── QIE_image2body_V2_dim4_1e-3-000078.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   └── qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       └── qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\n```\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Model links", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [550, 550], "pos": [-840, -140], "id": 99, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [950, 1040], "pos": [1070, -30], "widgets_values": ["QwenEditDummy"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 110, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 60, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.48", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [950, 1040], "pos": [2073.12841796875, -28.650514602661133], "widgets_values": ["QwenEditDummyInfo"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 617, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "na